      "body": "@rowasc  Noticed a few issues.Kindly confirm if they are valid.\r\n\r\n\r\n1.  When i added a Post to an anonymized Survey and i edit the Post Date. This date and Time is not anonymized as users can still see eddited dates. However this is not the case for posts which are not edited since they are rounded off.\r\n\r\n## Please Note the Survey has been Anonymized survey used Anonymization\r\n\r\n![time diffrence](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/36038029/43314483-bb98d85c-919b-11e8-9dfb-e889d560a996.png)\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/36038029/43314739-871d751e-919c-11e8-8b8c-b2db1c367c52.png)\r\n\r\n\r\n2. What are the permissions for Edit any posts? \r\n",
